brief:
The person tagged the bot in a reply. The post they tagged it in says:
@buildthis.bisks.net 

create a custom notification system that lets a bsky account create and view a list of words that is then pings their account when any of the users followers/following posts a word from that list

The thread it's replying to, oldest first (this is the context "this" refers to):
@slothropsmap.bsky.social: I’ve always wanted one of these apps to let me create a custom notification system that pings when [anyone I follow] posts [this word I care about]. 

It’s a bit of a power user feature but it would dramatically improve the quality of my experience.
